# A computed name sent to a constant in a string extraction does not parse
# as code (`eval`, a value's `class_eval`, after `__END__`) still names the
# constant. A `module_function`'s method sent to its module is a call of
# it (Util). A computed name sent to a constant without parentheses names
# it in a file with no interpolation (Lever, Crank, Pulley).
dead app Knob#level=unreferenced~Knob Spool#level=unreferenced~Spool Dial#level=unreferenced~Dial Util#helper=single-caller Lever#level=unreferenced~Lever Crank#level=unreferenced~Crank Pulley#level=unreferenced~Pulley
